id: enhanced-fusion
name: Enhanced Fusion
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
description: >
  Instead of relying on transforming your body, even as a Fusion, you maintain your focus on skill and technique.
text: >
  Enhanced Fusion: Instead of relying on transforming your body, even as a Fusion, you maintain your focus on skill and technique.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: You do not have access to any Forms
  (2)-[Passive]: While in a non-Transcended Enhancement, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: While you are using 2+ Enhancements in conjunction with another, increase your Wound Rolls by 2(T).
  (4)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: You may use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver to enter a non-Transcended Enhancement. If you do, leave that Transformation at the end of the turn (you do not suffer from Stress Exhaustion).

---

# (1) Its Prerequisite: shown as the Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs modifierChecks), never enforced.

[passive]
# (2) In a non-Transcended Enhancement: Combat Rolls 1(T).
if (inEnhancement) {
    combatRolls += 1(T);
}
# (3) 2+ Enhancements together (a Transcended one with another): Wound 2(T).
if (enhancementsAtLeast(2)) {
    wound += 2(T);
}

# (4) At the start of your turn: the Transformation Maneuver out of sequence, into a non-Transcended Enhancement; leaving it at the end of
# that turn, with no Stress Exhaustion: the table's.
[triggered/start-of-turn, outOfSequence, effect 4]
transformationOutOfSequence();
